  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/PremisHosturiondaArrosPassejatIsorteigCuinaTradicional.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) Hosturionda ha lliurat aquest dijous els premis del concurs d&#39;arr&ograve;s passejat al restaurant del Gran Hotel Toledo, Campus i Il Forno Medievale, i els dos sopars del sorteig de la II Ruta de cuina tradicional, guanyats per Amparo Santos Artero i Ismael Tena T&aacute;rrega.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0176.jpg\" alt=\"img_0176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0178.jpg\" alt=\"img_0178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0181.jpg\" alt=\"img_0181\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0185.jpg\" alt=\"img_0185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0186.jpg\" alt=\"img_0186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0187.jpg\" alt=\"img_0187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0191.jpg\" alt=\"img_0191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasoparsiarros/img_0193.jpg\" alt=\"img_0193\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premishosturiondasopa